# Prose and hand-authored config. README.md and BUILD_ANDROID.md are documents:
# their line breaks are where a sentence ends, not where column 100 falls, and
# reflowing them rewrites two thirds of the file to say the same thing. app.json
# is Expo's schema laid out one key per line so a permission or a plugin can be
# read at a glance — Prettier collapses those arrays onto one line.
*.md
*.json

# The two DATA TABLES.
#
# Both are lists of literal rows kept one-per-line on purpose, and both sit a
# couple of characters past 100: `seed.ts` is the shipped library and three
# routines, `history.ts` is a real training log used as a fixture. Prettier
# explodes any row that overruns into six lines of one key each, which turns a
# table you can scan into seventy lines you have to read. The formatter exists to
# make the codebase's existing consistency free, not to reformat the two files
# where a table IS the consistency.
src/data/seed.ts
test/fixtures/history.ts

